This is a simple arhcitecture which purpose is to generate telemetry data. 
There are 4 VMs within which 2 are the instances placed in 2 different availability zones, called WebVM-1 and WebVM-2. 
The same way AppVM-1 and AppVM-2 are created. They all have initially Azure Monitor Agent installed automatically due to being connected to a Data Collection Rule. 
The Data Collection Rule sends the telemetry data to the Log Analytics workspace. 
The data selected include all performance metrics, events and automatically generated heartbeats. 
The telemetry data is then quieried in Log Analytics Workspace with the KQL to discover the state of the VMs and any discrepancies.
